  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Accelerating SDGs through digitized, innovative and accessible  statistical system in Comoros-UNDP-COM-00131190</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">This joint proposal will support the Government of Comoros in fully harnessing the power of data revolution to efficiently monitor key indicators of development and enable informed and timely decision-making to reduce the country&#x2019;s vulnerabilities, accelerate the achievement of the SDGs aligned with the Comoros Emerging Plan by 2030, and support a more sustainable, equitable, and prosperous country.</narrative>
  </description>
